    "HIGH: scripts/bind-role-evidence.mjs still uses acquireLock() that, on any mkdir failure, stats the lock and removes it when older than five minutes before creating a replacement. It has no owner token, lease renewal, compare-and-remove, or proof that the original writer stopped. A binder running longer than five minutes can have its lock directory deleted by a second binder; both then append/rename ledger and accepted evidence concurrently, permitting lost updates or duplicate sequence numbers. The preparation-side lock was hardened, but the binder remains an independent writer and retains the stale-lock theft race.",
